Sporting an industrial olive-green and gold armor finish, "Hammerhead" features a heavily reinforced chassis with pressurized seals, high-intensity work lights, and a specialized propulsion system designed for high-speed underwater movement. Instead of traditional flight repulsors alone, its gauntlets and boots are optimized for hydro-propulsion and underwater defense, equipped with micro-torpedoes and high-power sonic cutters.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXXVII answers the House Party Protocol call at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces alongside the rest of the Iron Legion before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
